<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on the FTSE 100.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on the FTSE 100.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd has issued 25 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the FTSE 100 index, lead manager Morgan Stanley &amp; Co International Ltd said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE	ISS PRICE    PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	4250.0	3.57 GBP	9.17 PCT    11.80 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	4500.0	2.35 GBP     12.20 PCT    18.00 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	4750.0	1.42 GBP     15.92 PCT    29.70 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT D	 4250.0	2.51 GBP	5.24 PCT    16.80 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT E	 4000.0	1.65 GBP	9.12 PCT    25.60 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   22.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	27.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  4220.0</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
